### 1. Build and push ayushiranjan27/heatguard-web:2.1 (linux/arm64 + linux/amd64)
$ docker buildx build --platform linux/arm64,linux/amd64 -t ayushiranjan27/heatguard-web:2.1 -t ayushiranjan27/heatguard-web:latest --push --quiet ./frontend
sha256:115c2d8ab30476dea61e37b165e899cfef9d3c1aeeb1a00497dfe9106c0f7123

$ docker buildx imagetools inspect ayushiranjan27/heatguard-web:2.1 | grep Platform
  Platform:    linux/arm64
  Platform:    linux/amd64

